<p align="center"><b><font face="Scythe" size="6">Next Stop Terris Thule</font><font face="Scythe" size="5">!!</font></b></p>
<p align="left"><font face="Scythe" size="5"><b>Sunday January 24th. </b></font></p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left"><font face="Scythe" size="5"><b>Our brave brother Crakkah took
his family on a tour of the Plane of Nightmares Hedge. </b></font></p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left"><font face="Scythe" size="5"><b>We battled various mobs until
finally we came to a lovely fountain. Unfortunately a hideous creature decided
he wanted to eat us!</b></font></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="screenshots/Hedge1.bmp"></p>
<p align="left"><font face="Scythe" size="5"><b>At first we thought he was
Sular's friend but we were badly mistaken. </b></font></p>
<p align="left"><b><font face="Scythe" size="5">He abused us badly but we were
holding our own:</font></b></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="screenshots/Hedge2.bmp"></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="screenshots/Hedge3.bmp"></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="screenshots/Hedge4.bmp"></p>
<p align="left"><b><font face="Scythe" size="5">We owned him and his bootay was
ours!!</font></b></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="screenshots/Hedgedead.bmp"></p>
<p align="left"><b><font face="Scythe" size="5">Just when things were getting
fun Terris Thule decided to show up and harass us!</font></b></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="screenshots/Teris%20Thule.bmp"></p>
<p align="left"><b><font face="Scythe" size="5">We ran her skank hiney off and
